sequenceDiagram
  participant kubelet as Kubelet
  participant patroni as Patroni PID 1
  participant postgres as PostgreSQL
  participant dcs as Kubernetes DCS
  kubelet->>patroni: SIGTERM with 180-second default grace
  patroni->>postgres: Patroni-managed shutdown
  patroni->>dcs: HA shutdown and leader-lock coordination
  postgres-->>patroni: Database stopped
  patroni-->>kubelet: Process exit
  participant pgcat as PgCat
  kubelet->>pgcat: Image stop signal SIGINT
  pgcat->>pgcat: Drain clients up to 60-second config timeout
  pgcat-->>kubelet: Exit within 90-second pod grace
  participant watcher as Configuration watcher
  kubelet->>watcher: SIGTERM
  watcher->>watcher: Stop watching, finish write, flush logger
  watcher-->>kubelet: Exit 0 with 5-second bound
  participant api as FastAPI and Uvicorn
  kubelet->>api: SIGTERM
  api->>api: Wait for in-flight work up to 690 seconds
  api-->>kubelet: Exit before 720-second pod deadline
